      "type": "text",
      "text": "**cloudy-u-containers**  ◀ THIS REPO\ncode · 🌐 public · 1.1.3.1.1\nContainer service definitions for the cloud fleet (split from cloud-infra/a_solutions)\n[GitHub](https://github.com/diegonmarcos/cloudy-u-containers)",
